TI  - An Active Learning Didactic Proposal with Human-Computer Interaction in Engineering Education: A Direct Current Motor Case Study
PY  - 2022
Y1  - 2022
JO  - Electronics (Switzerland)
T2  - Electronics (Switzerland)
