TI  - Validation of the Internet entrepreneurial self-efficacy scale among Romanian technical students.
PY  - 2024
Y1  - 2024
JO  - PLoS ONE
T2  - PLoS ONE
J2  - PLoS One
VL  - 19
IS  - 10
SP  - 1
EP  - 18
