TI  - Engineering Graphics Literacy and Manufacturing Performance: A Cross-National Mixed-Methods Study of CAD Competency Gaps, Standards Compliance Deficiencies, and Their Industrial Consequences
PY  - 2026
Y1  - 2026
JO  - Applied Sciences (Switzerland)
T2  - Applied Sciences (Switzerland)
VL  - 16
