TI  - The development, validation and use of an interprofessional project management questionnaire in engineering education.
PY  - 2023
Y1  - 2023
JO  - European Journal of Engineering Education
T2  - European Journal of Engineering Education
J2  - Eur. J. Eng. Educ.
VL  - 48
IS  - 3
