TI  - Workplace Climate for First-Generation Engineering Faculty: Intersectional Analyses with Gender, Race/Ethnicity, and Socioeconomic Background
PY  - 2022
Y1  - 2022
T2  - 2022 IEEE Frontiers in Education Conference (FIE)
VL  - 2022-October
