ned system in the ocean at Dana Point (SRL9). The authors believe that demonstration of student development across all 9 SRLs in a two-semester sophomore level course is novel. Further, the application of SRLs for evaluation of student readiness is a tool that can be applied in other parts of our program, and in engineering and other professional programs more broadly. © 2017, American Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics Inc, AIAA. All rights reserved.
