TI  - Assessing the Self-Efficacy Level of Freshmen on Ethical Research and Practices in Engineering
PY  - 2023
Y1  - 2023
T2  - 2023 IEEE Frontiers in Education Conference (FIE)
SP  - 1
EP  - 4
