TI  - Future of Digital Entrepreneurship: The Expanded Role of Government in the Entrepreneurial Event Model
PY  - 2025
Y1  - 2025
JO  - Information Systems Research in Vietnam, Volume 3: A Shared Vision and New Frontiers
T2  - Information Systems Research in Vietnam, Volume 3: A Shared Vision and New Frontiers
VL  - 3
SP  - 1
