TI  - Developing the Indonesian Qualifications Framework's descriptors for Electrical Engineering as the basis of the Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL)
PY  - 2018
Y1  - 2018
T2  - Journal of Physics: Conference Series
VL  - 1140
