TI  - I’m not Stuck – I’m Learning:: Operationalizing Self-efficacy Trajectories in Large-Scale AI Learning Environments
PY  - 2027
Y1  - 2027
T2  - Lecture Notes in Computer Science
VL  - 16584 LNAI
SP  - 185
