TI  - Attitude Towards Research in Formative Research Among University Students: An Analysis from the Perspective of Autonomous Investigative Learning
PY  - 2025
Y1  - 2025
JO  - Seminars in Medical Writing and Education
T2  - Seminars in Medical Writing and Education
VL  - 4
