TI  - Validation of the Academic Analogue of Psychological Momentum Theory on Sophomore Engineering Undergraduates for the Promotion of SDG4 Quality Education
PY  - 2024
Y1  - 2024
JO  - Journal of Engineering Education Transformations
T2  - Journal of Engineering Education Transformations
