TI  - Measuring the Influence of Using Technology on Individuals’ Feelings of Autonomy, Competence, and Relatedness
PY  - 2025
Y1  - 2025
JO  - International Journal of Human-Computer Interaction
T2  - International Journal of Human-Computer Interaction
