TI  - Conceptual Model of Technical Sustainability for Integration Into Electrical/Electronic Engineering Programmes in Nigerian Polytechnics
PY  - 2020
Y1  - 2020
JO  - IEEE Access
T2  - IEEE Access
VL  - 8
SP  - 128519
