TI  - Student Enterprises in Electrical Engineering of UBE: Innovative Solutions to Energy Problems in Ecuador
PY  - 2025
Y1  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings of the LACCEI international Multi-conference for Engineering, Education and Technology
IS  - 2025
