TI  - An Interactive Dashboard to Support Policymaking of Reopening School on Covid-19 Pandemic
PY  - 2022
Y1  - 2022
T2  - 2022 IEEE 9th International Conference on Computational Intelligence and Virtual Environments for Measurement Systems and Applications (CIVEMSA)
SP  - 1
