esign planning, individual and team work is around 65.6%, 90.5% and 84.2% respectively. However there is scope for improvement in area of coding as the attainment is comparatively low with 72.5%. As per the students' feedback, their learning is enhanced after having undergone this activity in comparison with classroom learning.
