TI  - Designing and Validating a Concept Map Coding Scheme: Practical Applications for Engineering Education.
PY  - 2026
Y1  - 2026
JO  - Journal of Integrated Design & Process Science
T2  - Journal of Integrated Design & Process Science
VL  - 29
