TI  - Full-Scale Aggregated MobileUNet: An Improved U-Net Architecture for SAR Oil Spill Detection.
PY  - 2024
Y1  - 2024
JO  - Sensors (14248220)
T2  - Sensors (14248220)
VL  - 24
